# Storybook — stopped until user says otherwise

**Do not** start, restart, open, connect to, or rely on Storybook on this machine until the user explicitly asks.

Forbidden unless the user says so:
- Running `npm run storybook`, `storybook dev`, or any Storybook CLI
- Opening or using `http://localhost:6006` (or other Storybook ports)
- Killing/restarting Storybook “to help” or as part of boot/dev setup
- Pointing the ATB Invoice / PnP Vibes work at the design-system Storybook

If Storybook appears running, leave it alone unless the user asks to stop or use it.
